3234217701742"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114522536322994413"],"id":"2114522536322994413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":52,"impression_count":138924,"like_count":188,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":57,"retweet_count":9},"text":"海军副司令王守业，私生活丰富到什么程度？\n\n身边养着8️⃣房“姨太太”，最大五十多，最小的二十出头\n这哥们还挺不错，新的来了，旧的也不去\n\n后来他被叫到珠海开会，会开到一半，军纪委直接会场带人。\n王副司令见势不妙，当场掏出随身配轮，想自我了断","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114522536322994413"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114522404764701138"],"id":"2114522404764701138","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":133,"impression_count":92369,"like_count":354,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":82,"retweet_count":29},"text":"中国会重蹈日本长期停滞覆辙吗？\n\n10月21日，《金融时报》深度报道文章指出，中国与日本当年的经济困境存在明显相似之处：人口下降、通缩压力、消费疲弱，以及房地产和股市低迷。中国房地产泡沫于2021年破裂后，新开工住宅数量较峰值下降78%。 https://t.co/ddkMBWcWwv","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114522404764701138"},{"author_id":"1451036242431262720","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114522399060488685"],"id":"2114522399060488685","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":35037,"like_count":344,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":359,"retweet_count":37},"text":"GM 💛 大家的Agent ID都叫什么呢 👀 https://t.co/NUIscxYIgG","url":"https://x.com/binancezh/status/2114522399060488685"},{"author_id":"44186175","created_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114519079600243098"],"id":"2114519079600243098","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":10338,"like_count":72,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":7},"text":"美国新移民人数的变化情况。自特朗普上任起，合法移民从18万减为5万，非法移民从5万减为1万。（月数据） https://t.co/cMwN0eq0ZF","url":"https://x.com/xiaojingcanxue/status/2114519079600243098"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114519057462636645"],"id":"2114519057462636645","public_metrics":{"bookma